Z||000014||snafus87||09-10-2001||05:48 PM||||Hi all...<BR>I know its been awhile since I've said anything on here, since the BBQ.<P>I just wanted to let those of you who might be interested from the BBQ (Fleabitdog, etc..) that the wiring harness worked wonderfully...as for the headliner having the 3rd brake light...no problem either...went to the junkyard that Sunday and found a light, along with that rocker panel (the one you told me about Jen).  Got that put on and everything is working perfectly...except it rained here today, and I got dribbled on through my sunroof.....<P>I read somewhere in a list (either here or on Wallace's) that 84-86's I think didn't have the drain holes in the roof channels...Is there anyone who can verify this and let me know where I should drill to put my own drain holes so it doesn't leak and ruin my new headliner???<P><BR>Thanks in advance...||||reg||14
